;
; How Fell files one casualty of an incident in MYRA (fell_rules.h FR7):
; a sparse record under the incident and the casualty's number, with the
; search sector they were found in, their triage category as the team
; recorded it (1 immediate, 2 delayed, 3 minor, 4 deceased, 0 not yet
; triaged; Fell infers nothing clinical) and when they were found (ms
; since 1970). The model asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps
; the casualty or writes it to the Hoard.
^ZXFELL(incident:i6, casualty:i3) = sector:i4! ^ triage:i1! ^ stamp:i13!
